## Reproducing everything

```bash
uv tool install mjolnir-cli
mjolnir hw setup                     # locked clocks, MAXN, fans — stable numbers
mjolnir verify all                   # correctness + every benchmark stage (≈ hours; gated)
mjolnir plot --readme                # charts + README + these pages, from the raw results
```

Each stage writes one JSON file per run. A run with non-default parameters (`--ls`, `--variants`, …) is saved too but never replaces the headline chart, so exploratory A/Bs are safe to commit. Methodology and the noise floor: [`docs/methodology/benchmarking.md`]({{ root }}docs/methodology/benchmarking.md).
